  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resettlement Programme with the Government of Denmark from Ethiopia, Rwanda, and T&#xfc;rkiye under the 2022 and 2023 Resettlement Quotas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to providing a durable solution to 400 people in need of international protection in Ethiopia, Rwanda and T&#xfc;rkiye by facilitating their resettlement to Denmark. The project will support representatives of the Danish Immigration Service and project beneficiaries to engage in the selection process for resettlement and in pre-departure orientation sessions. Beneficiaries&#x2019; medical needs and public health concerns will also be assessed and addressed and resettlement to Denmark organized in a safe, regular and informed manner.</narrative>
  </description>
